  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline CAVIAR is a six-sided shaped co-polyester designed for maximum precision, all-court control and strong court penetration. Compared with traditional polyester strings, CAVIAR is positioned as more lively and flexible while retaining exceptional durability and tension maintenance. Its hexagonal geometry provides spin and ball grip, while the responsive construction helps players redirect pace and drive through the court with confidence. Available in 1.16, 1.20 and 1.24 mm gauges.",

    "zh": "Toroline CAVIAR 是一款以最大精准度、全场控制和穿透力为核心的六边形共聚酯球线。相比传统聚酯线，CAVIAR 的反馈更加灵活、有活力，同时保持非常出色的耐久和保磅表现。六边形结构负责提供旋转和咬球，而更具弹性的响应则帮助球员更容易改变来球方向，并把球更有穿透力地打过场地。产品提供 1.16、1.20 和 1.24 毫米三个线径。"
  },

